      "Healthy aging is rarely about chasing a single hormone number. It's the accumulation of consistent, fairly unglamorous habits: enough sleep, regular resistance training, manageable stress, a reasonable body composition, and real medical evaluation when something feels genuinely off rather than just guessing.",
